{"id":"gana","lemma":"gana","pos":"noun","rank":1052,"glosses":["best translated with to feel like, to want","urge, uses a \"tengo ganas de\" or \"me dan ganas de\" construction"],"ipa":"/ˈɡana/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"ganas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-gana.wav","formAudio":{"ganas":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-ganas.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"¿Cuánto gana él al mes?","en":"How much does he earn per month?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/767786","words":[{"g":"how much"},null,{"g":"he"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"month"}]},{"text":"Él gana veinte dólares al día.","en":"He earns twenty dollars a day.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/587276","words":[{"g":"he"},null,{"g":"twenty"},{"g":"dollar","l":"dólar"},null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"per day"]]},{"text":"El equipo más rápido gana.","en":"The fastest team wins.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/301875","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"team"},{"g":"more"},{"g":"rapid"},null]},{"text":"¿Quién gana?","en":"Who's winning?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/65209","words":[{"g":"who"},null]},{"text":"No tenía ninguna gana de hacerlo.","en":"I didn't have any desire to do that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/435753","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"nobody","l":"ninguno"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"}]}]}